{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734770",
      "title": "Handle Loading State",
      "sourceHash": "925454f4a88ac0d54905209bcdc6c91b7ae1c2ac41ec77a9fe45b696fbb91a7c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 5.04,
          "en": "Now we added the user fact hook to fetch data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.04,
          "end": 6.27,
          "en": "and this is all looking good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.27,
          "end": 7.98,
          "en": "And if we load this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.98,
          "end": 10.32,
          "en": "the data shows up pretty much instantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.32,
          "end": 13.29,
          "en": "Now that's also the case because the backend is running",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.29,
          "end": 15.72,
          "en": "on the same server, on the same machine,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.72,
          "end": 18.06,
          "en": "our local machine, as the front end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.06,
          "end": 19.77,
          "en": "And therefore this HTTP request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.77,
          "end": 22.89,
          "en": "and all these things are happening super fast.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.89,
          "end": 26.19,
          "en": "In reality, sending that request here for fetching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.19,
          "end": 29.82,
          "en": "or for storing the data might sometimes take some time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.82,
          "end": 31.62,
          "en": "It's not that bad because,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.62,
          "end": 36,
          "en": "in the end here we are fine with still updating the posts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36,
          "end": 39.09,
          "en": "in our local state immediately,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.09,
          "end": 41.61,
          "en": "and we just send this request kind of behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.61,
          "end": 44.13,
          "en": "And it doesn't matter if it takes a second or two,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.13,
          "end": 46.17,
          "en": "but for fetching the data, it would be bad,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.17,
          "end": 48.81,
          "en": "if the backend would be a bit slower.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.81,
          "end": 51.45,
          "en": "We can simulate this by going to the backend code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.45,
          "end": 53.88,
          "en": "And there you find this line of code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.88,
          "end": 57.39,
          "en": "in the get posts route here in this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.39,
          "end": 58.653,
          "en": "which you can comment in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.64,
          "end": 61.83,
          "en": "This simply adds a delay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 61.83,
          "end": 63.51,
          "en": "Of course, it's not realistic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 63.51,
          "end": 65.67,
          "en": "that you would add such a delay, but this is just",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 65.67,
          "end": 68.883,
          "en": "for demo purposes to simulate a slower backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.75,
          "end": 71.67,
          "en": "If you comment this in and save this file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 71.67,
          "end": 74.07,
          "en": "you can quit this server with control C",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.07,
          "end": 76.62,
          "en": "and restart it to make sure that those changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 76.62,
          "end": 78.6,
          "en": "are taken into account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 78.6,
          "end": 82.02,
          "en": "And now you will see that if I reload this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.02,
          "end": 86.49,
          "en": "I see there are no posts yet first before the data shows up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 86.49,
          "end": 90.84,
          "en": "And this is not necessarily the ideal behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 90.84,
          "end": 94.44,
          "en": "because the user doesn't really see what's going on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 94.44,
          "end": 96.72,
          "en": "and it looks like there really are no posts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 96.72,
          "end": 99.21000000000001,
          "en": "until suddenly they do show up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.21000000000001,
          "end": 101.94,
          "en": "You instead might wanna show some loading text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.94,
          "end": 104.85,
          "en": "or loading spinner, whilst the user is waiting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 104.85,
          "end": 107.07,
          "en": "for the data so that we differentiate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 107.07,
          "end": 109.89,
          "en": "between scenarios where we have no data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 109.89,
          "end": 113.043,
          "en": "and where we're simply still waiting for the data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 114.06,
          "end": 118.38,
          "en": "And to achieve this, what we could do, is in post list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.38,
          "end": 123.03,
          "en": "we can add another new state with useState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 123.03,
          "end": 128.03,
          "en": "and that would be a state which I'll name is fetching,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.27,
          "end": 133.98,
          "en": "with the set is fetching state updating function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.98,
          "end": 135.54,
          "en": "And initially that's false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.54,
          "end": 138.03,
          "en": "so it should be a bullion value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.03,
          "end": 140.79,
          "en": "And the idea is that we set this to true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 140.79,
          "end": 144.06,
          "en": "right when we start fetching our posts in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.06,
          "end": 146.28300000000002,
          "en": "and we set it to false thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 148.59,
          "end": 151.05,
          "en": "With that, we have this fetching state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 151.05,
          "end": 154.2,
          "en": "and we can use that to show an alternative UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.2,
          "end": 156.63,
          "en": "whilst we're fetching data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.63,
          "end": 160.35,
          "en": "So in the JSX code down there, we only wanna show the posts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.35,
          "end": 163.59,
          "en": "or the fallback text if we're not fetching.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 163.59,
          "end": 166.53,
          "en": "So if we're not fetching, if this is false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 166.53,
          "end": 168.9,
          "en": "and posts length is greater zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 168.9,
          "end": 170.61,
          "en": "we wanna show the posts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 170.61,
          "end": 173.4,
          "en": "And similarly, if we're not fetching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 173.4,
          "end": 175.59,
          "en": "and posts length is equal to zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 175.59,
          "end": 177.993,
          "en": "we wanna show the no posts text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 179.55,
          "end": 182.01,
          "en": "Because, and that's a new scenario.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 182.01,
          "end": 187.01,
          "en": "If we are fetching, then I instead rather want to show",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 187.38,
          "end": 191.97,
          "en": "a paragraph where I say loading post dot, dot, dot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 191.97,
          "end": 193.26,
          "en": "something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 193.26,
          "end": 196.653,
          "en": "And I'll wrap this into a div here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 198.3,
          "end": 201.39,
          "en": "which also centers this and turns it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 201.39,
          "end": 204.963,
          "en": "into some white text like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 207.3,
          "end": 208.74,
          "en": "With that, if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 208.74,
          "end": 212.57999999999998,
          "en": "we now see loading posts initially until the posts appear.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.57999999999998,
          "end": 215.82,
          "en": "And that arguably provides a better user experience",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.82,
          "end": 217.23,
          "en": "than showing this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 217.23,
          "end": 219,
          "en": "There are no posts message instead,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 219,
          "end": 220.44,
          "en": "which is technically wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 220.44,
          "end": 223.53300000000002,
          "en": "There are posts, we're just still waiting for them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 224.55,
          "end": 226.32,
          "en": "So that's how we could handle a loading state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 226.32,
          "end": 227.64,
          "en": "And that's another improvement,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 227.64,
          "end": 230.553,
          "en": "you might want to add when fetching data like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 231.42000000000002,
          "end": 232.38,
          "en": "Now that being said,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 232.38,
          "end": 235.05,
          "en": "there are more things we could improve here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 235.05,
          "end": 237.66,
          "en": "We might also want to handle some error state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 237.66,
          "end": 241.71,
          "en": "and check if the response is maybe not okay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 241.71,
          "end": 243.57,
          "en": "So if we had an error response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 243.57,
          "end": 245.94,
          "en": "and in that case I'll put an error message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 245.94,
          "end": 248.79,
          "en": "and you can definitely try doing that as an exercise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 248.79,
          "end": 250.11,
          "en": "Here, I'll not do it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 250.11,
          "end": 252.96,
          "en": "because this is just a crash course getting you started,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 252.96,
          "end": 255.12,
          "en": "it is an improvement you might wanna add,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 255.12,
          "end": 258,
          "en": "but I'd rather dive into more advanced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 258,
          "end": 261.063,
          "en": "and useful React features, which is what we'll do next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}